{"Blacklist comparison lowercases stored blacklisted emails but not the incoming `guest` email, allowing emails like `User@Blacklisted.com` to bypass the blacklist check": 0.9522804617881775, "The `isTeamAdminOrOwner` check uses `&&` (AND) instead of `||` (OR), requiring the user to be both a team admin and owner simultaneously, incorrectly denying access to team admins who are not owners": 0.9730148315429688, "`sendAddGuestsEmails` is called with raw `guests` input instead of `uniqueGuests`, causing existing attendees to incorrectly receive 'scheduled' emails instead of 'guests added' notifications": 0.8597249388694763, "Caught error is not logged - only a static string is printed, making debugging failures impossible": 0.9317143559455872, "`this.calEvent.attendees[0].name` accesses the first element without a bounds check, causing a runtime error if `attendees` is empty": 0.8140554428100586, "When `err.data?.code` is `undefined`, the template literal produces `\"undefined: ...\"` which prevents the fallback message from triggering, showing a confusing message to users": 0.9749496579170227, "Tooltip content `\"Remove email\"` is a hardcoded English string instead of using `t()` for i18n consistency": 0.6967751979827881}